[2025-10-29 17:20:28] [34mINFO[0;39m [36mliquibase.changelog                     [0;39m [35m:37  [0;39m New row inserted into notification_templates
[2025-10-29 17:20:28] [39mDEBUG[0;39m [36mliquibase.database                      [0;39m [35m:37  [0;39m Executing Statement: liquibase.statement.core.InsertStatement@6296aca
[2025-10-29 17:20:28] [39mDEBUG[0;39m [36mliquibase.executor                      [0;39m [35m:37  [0;39m INSERT INTO public.notification_templates (language_id, notification_type, title, body, notification_receiver_type) VALUES ('2', 'COURIER_ITINERARY_FORMED', 'Route created', 'Hello! We have created the route for your UBS Courier. Your Courier will arrive tomorrow ${date}. Courier’s hours of operation: from ${startTime} to ${endTime}. Please be available during this time frame and make sure your phone is not on “silent”. The Courier will call you in advance, and upon arrival. If you are unable to be present during the agreed time, you may leave your bags with the concierge, but please, do notify your Courier or one of the managers! Courier’s number - ${phoneNumber}. We will gladly answer any questions you might still have! Chat with a manager t.me/nowaste_service_bot or email hello@nowaste.org.ua', 'OTHER')
