38175035 або +380931038987. Якщо у вас залишилися будь-які питання - з радістю відповім! Чат з менеджеркою https://t.me/nowaste_service_bot  чи e-mail hello@nowaste.org.ua' AND body_eng = 'Hello! We have created the route for your UBS Courier, order №${orderNumber}.Your Courier will arrive ${date}. Courier’s hours of operation: from ${startTime} to ${endTime}. Please be available during this time frame and make sure your phone is not on “silent”. The Courier will call you in advance, and upon arrival. If you are unable to be present during the agreed time, you may leave your bags with the concierge, but please, do notify your Courier or one of the managers! Courier’s number — +380638175035 or +380931038987. We will gladly answer any questions you might still have! Chat with a manager https://t.me/nowaste_service_bot  or email hello@nowaste.org.ua'
